      "updated": 1789458584382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Node js -> Node is a runtime env of the js that is used to create the backend servers ,\ngive the abilty to use the backend tools && packages.\n\n2> Node js is the event driven arch -> based on events \n\n3> it has given the power to the js so thatwe can use the javascript beyod the briowser\nthis power make the js as a full stack framemwork language\n\n4. IT deals with the NPM packages aslo so that we can just use the things like the packages or the\nexternal lib of the ndeo js so taht we can , just use it ina command\n\nit also provides you the ability of the non Blocking I/O operations && concurrency part as welll\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Node js -> Node is a runtime env of the js that is used to create the backend servers ,\ngive the abilty to use the backend tools && packages.\n\n2> Node js is the event driven arch -> based on events \n\n3> it has given the power to the js so thatwe can use the javascript beyod the briowser\nthis power make the js as a full stack framemwork language\n\n4. IT deals with the NPM packages aslo so that we can just use the things like the packages or the\nexternal lib of the ndeo js so taht we can , just use it ina command\n\nit also provides you the ability of the non Blocking I/O operations && concurrency part as welll\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
