      "updated": 1789463414716,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Point                  | JavaScript Engine                                           | Node.js                                                   |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What is it?**        | JavaScript code ko execute karne wala engine                | JavaScript ko **browser ke bahar** run karne wala runtime |\n| **Main job**           | JS code ko understand/execute karna                         | JS code execute karna + server-side capabilities dena     |\n| **Example**            | **V8**, SpiderMonkey, JavaScriptCore                        | **Node.js**                                               |\n| **V8 ka role**         | JavaScript execute karta hai                                | Node.js ke andar V8 JavaScript execute karta hai          |\n| **Environment**        | Khud sirf JS execution provide karta hai                    | Complete runtime environment provide karta hai            |\n| **Web APIs**           | Engine khud `http`, `fs`, `process` etc. provide nahi karta | Node.js server-side APIs provide karta hai                |\n| **File System**        | Direct `fs` access nahi                                     | `fs` module se files access kar sakta hai                 |\n| **HTTP Server**        | Khud HTTP server functionality nahi                         | HTTP server bana sakte ho                                 |\n| **Database/Network**   | Engine ka direct responsibility nahi                        | Networking/database libraries ke through possible         |\n| **Event Loop**         | Engine ka primary concept nahi                              | Node.js runtime event loop use karta hai                  |\n| **Modules**            | Engine alone Node.js modules nahi deta                      | CommonJS / ES Modules support karta hai                   |\n| **Package Management** | Nahi                                                        | **npm** ecosystem                                         |\n| **Example**            | Chrome mein V8 JavaScript execute karta hai                 | `node app.js` se server-side JS run hoti hai              |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Point                  | JavaScript Engine                                           | Node.js                                                   |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What is it?**        | JavaScript code ko execute karne wala engine                | JavaScript ko **browser ke bahar** run karne wala runtime |\n| **Main job**           | JS code ko understand/execute karna                         | JS code execute karna + server-side capabilities dena     |\n| **Example**            | **V8**, SpiderMonkey, JavaScriptCore                        | **Node.js**                                               |\n| **V8 ka role**         | JavaScript execute karta hai                                | Node.js ke andar V8 JavaScript execute karta hai          |\n| **Environment**        | Khud sirf JS execution provide karta hai                    | Complete runtime environment provide karta hai            |\n| **Web APIs**           | Engine khud `http`, `fs`, `process` etc. provide nahi karta | Node.js server-side APIs provide karta hai                |\n| **File System**        | Direct `fs` access nahi                                     | `fs` module se files access kar sakta hai                 |\n| **HTTP Server**        | Khud HTTP server functionality nahi                         | HTTP server bana sakte ho                                 |\n| **Database/Network**   | Engine ka direct responsibility nahi                        | Networking/database libraries ke through possible         |\n| **Event Loop**         | Engine ka primary concept nahi                              | Node.js runtime event loop use karta hai                  |\n| **Modules**            | Engine alone Node.js modules nahi deta                      | CommonJS / ES Modules support karta hai                   |\n| **Package Management** | Nahi                                                        | **npm** ecosystem                                         |\n| **Example**            | Chrome mein V8 JavaScript execute karta hai                 | `node app.js` se server-side JS run hoti hai              |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
