      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789464467676,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. What is Event-Driven Architecture?\nEvent-Driven Architecture (EDA) ek software architecture pattern hai.\nIsmein system ka flow events ke basis par hota hai.\nEvent ka matlab hai: system mein koi action/occurrence hua.\nExamples: OrderPlaced, PaymentCompleted, UserRegistered.\n\n\n2. Iska basic meaning\nJab koi important event hota hai, system us event ki information publish karta hai.\nJis component/service ko us event ki zarurat hoti hai, woh us event ko receive karke apna kaam karta hai.\nIsliye components ko har baar directly ek-dusre ko call karna zaroori nahi hota.\n\n\n3. Kyu use hua?\nLarge applications mein bahut saare components ek-dusre se communicate karte hain.\nDirect communication se components ke beech tight coupling badh sakti hai.\nEk component ko doosre components ki dependency aur implementation ke baare mein pata rehna pad sakta hai.\nEDA ka purpose components ko loosely coupled banana hai.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. What is Event-Driven Architecture?\nEvent-Driven Architecture (EDA) ek software architecture pattern hai.\nIsmein system ka flow events ke basis par hota hai.\nEvent ka matlab hai: system mein koi action/occurrence hua.\nExamples: OrderPlaced, PaymentCompleted, UserRegistered.\n\n\n2. Iska basic meaning\nJab koi important event hota hai, system us event ki information publish karta hai.\nJis component/service ko us event ki zarurat hoti hai, woh us event ko receive karke apna kaam karta hai.\nIsliye components ko har baar directly ek-dusre ko call karna zaroori nahi hota.\n\n\n3. Kyu use hua?\nLarge applications mein bahut saare components ek-dusre se communicate karte hain.\nDirect communication se components ke beech tight coupling badh sakti hai.\nEk component ko doosre components ki dependency aur implementation ke baare mein pata rehna pad sakta hai.\nEDA ka purpose components ko loosely coupled banana hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
