      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789465069982,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "|               | **Concurrency**                             | **Parallelism**                                         |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Meaning**   | Multiple tasks ko **manage/progress** karna | Multiple tasks ko **same time execute** karna           |\n| **Execution** | Tasks **interleave/switch** ho sakte hain   | Tasks **simultaneously** execute hote hain              |\n| **CPU**       | Single core par bhi possible                | Multiple cores ka use generally hota hai                |\n| **Node.js**   | **Event Loop → concurrency**                | **Worker Threads/Processes → parallelism**              |\n| **Goal**      | Many tasks ko efficiently handle karna      | Tasks ko simultaneously execute karke time reduce karna |\n",
      "fontSize": 29.610385130023623,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "|               | **Concurrency**                             | **Parallelism**                                         |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Meaning**   | Multiple tasks ko **manage/progress** karna | Multiple tasks ko **same time execute** karna           |\n| **Execution** | Tasks **interleave/switch** ho sakte hain   | Tasks **simultaneously** execute hote hain              |\n| **CPU**       | Single core par bhi possible                | Multiple cores ka use generally hota hai                |\n| **Node.js**   | **Event Loop → concurrency**                | **Worker Threads/Processes → parallelism**              |\n| **Goal**      | Many tasks ko efficiently handle karna      | Tasks ko simultaneously execute karke time reduce karna |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
