    {
      "id": "W8MRQsCi5A6zUNTRHWUGw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -194.62401379748962,
      "y": 11447.474878470224,
      "width": 2012.7105461746619,
      "height": 319.461000289004,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 446027426,
      "version": 16,
      "versionNonce": 38927842,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789465192046,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "libuv — Main Points\nEvent Loop provide/implement karta hai → asynchronous tasks ko coordinate karta hai.\nNon-blocking I/O enable karta hai → I/O operations ke wait mein JS thread ko unnecessarily block nahi hone deta.\nThread Pool provide karta hai → kuch operations ko background threads par handle karta hai.\nOS-level I/O ko abstract karta hai → different operating systems ke APIs ke saath Node.js ko work karne mein help karta hai.\nAsync operations ke completion ko manage karta hai → operation complete hone par callback/continuation ko execute hone ke flow mein laata hai.\n🔥 Bas yaad rakho:\n\nlibuv = Event Loop + Async I/O + Thread Pool + OS-level I/O handling",
      "fontSize": 28.396533359022573,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "libuv — Main Points\nEvent Loop provide/implement karta hai → asynchronous tasks ko coordinate karta hai.\nNon-blocking I/O enable karta hai → I/O operations ke wait mein JS thread ko unnecessarily block nahi hone deta.\nThread Pool provide karta hai → kuch operations ko background threads par handle karta hai.\nOS-level I/O ko abstract karta hai → different operating systems ke APIs ke saath Node.js ko work karne mein help karta hai.\nAsync operations ke completion ko manage karta hai → operation complete hone par callback/continuation ko execute hone ke flow mein laata hai.\n🔥 Bas yaad rakho:\n\nlibuv = Event Loop + Async I/O + Thread Pool + OS-level I/O handling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
