    {
      "id": "SShL19-P4tyvLhtj_yMG_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -174.91040327436428,
      "y": 11840.104338190107,
      "width": 2032.8204448181634,
      "height": 231.31864340789159,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 221318718,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 1731054882,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789465236862,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Without libuv — kya problem hoti?\nEvent Loop ka current implementation nahi hota → asynchronous tasks ko coordinate karna difficult hota.\nNon-blocking I/O ka mechanism nahi hota → file/network jaise operations ko efficiently handle karna difficult hota.\nThread Pool nahi hota → certain operations ke liye background threads ka existing Node.js mechanism nahi hota.\nCross-platform I/O handling nahi hoti → Windows/Linux/macOS ke different OS-level I/O APIs ko Node.js ko khud handle karna padta.\nResult: Node.js ka current efficient asynchronous I/O model possible nahi hota.",
      "fontSize": 30.84248578771887,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Without libuv — kya problem hoti?\nEvent Loop ka current implementation nahi hota → asynchronous tasks ko coordinate karna difficult hota.\nNon-blocking I/O ka mechanism nahi hota → file/network jaise operations ko efficiently handle karna difficult hota.\nThread Pool nahi hota → certain operations ke liye background threads ka existing Node.js mechanism nahi hota.\nCross-platform I/O handling nahi hoti → Windows/Linux/macOS ke different OS-level I/O APIs ko Node.js ko khud handle karna padta.\nResult: Node.js ka current efficient asynchronous I/O model possible nahi hota.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "52zJdRyfVBXeeft4t_I2q",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -289.9064395921099,
